      "message": "feat(motion): wire EDM 2-axis contour generator - kerf offset to a stated side, start hole, corner minimum\n\nThe wire-centre path is the one closed profile's mitred parallel at the\nkerf offset (wire radius + the condition's spark gap), inside it for a\ndie and outside it for a punch; a straight lead joins it to the stated\nstart hole and back. An inside corner or slot tighter than the offset,\na missing or misplaced start hole, an open, crossing or area-less\nprofile are refused by name. The moves ride one plane and state no pose\nand no feed (#290 D2).\n\nRefs #532\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
