      "message": "feat(edm): Wire Contour operation - the machine's condition at the command door, no library tool, CL goldens\n\nOpType::WireContour (id 41) in its own Wire EDM section and family,\nadmitted on a wire EDM only. The op names the machine condition it burns\nwith; CreateOperation / EditOperationParams refuse a missing condition,\ngap or wire diameter by name (#531's door), and refuse a library tool on\na wire cut - the condition table is the wire's one source. The stamp\ndigests the condition's wire and gap, so an edited table re-marks the\ncut Stale. Generation runs motion::wire_edm over the picked profile or\nthe model's through-silhouette. The machine check judges X/Y travel and\nnames what it does not judge; the post refuses a wire cut by name until\na wire post exists (#533).\n\nRefs #532\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
