      "message": "feat(edm): Wire Contour page fields, registry pins and the decision record\n\nThe UI's tab law draws every kind's sections, so the Wire Contour gets a\nminimal page: side and start hole on Geometry, the workpiece planes on\nHeights, the machine's conditions to choose from on Passes, no Feeds tab\n(a wire cut states no feed). The ribbon tip names a wire EDM, not a\nmill-turn, as the machine wire work needs. The registry's count pins\nmove to 42 kinds; the tool-law tests state the one family that mounts no\nlibrary tool. docs/decisions/532-wire-contour.md records what the\numbrella left open.\n\nFixes #532\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
