      },
      "message": "Merge origin/main into issue/532-wire-contour\n\nConflicts resolved, main's moves followed:\n- operation/job.rs: main's inline tool read stays in tool_gate::job_tool,\n  which now also returns the #852 neck (a wire carries none).\n- operation/stamp.rs: main's #852 neck digest moved into\n  stamp_tool::write, same bytes in the same order.\n- posting.rs: main's posting_family::family_at_post kept; the #532\n  refusal of a kind with no post moved into it.\n- tests/golden_cl.rs: main's gate map plus motion::wire_edm.\n- ui panes.rs: op_icon left panes.rs on main (op_icons.rs).\n\nKept compiling with main's new per-kind tables: fidelity_law (WireEdm\nnot excess-aware, like plasma), lathe_voice (Wire Contour refused by\nname on a lathe post) and op_icons (an original op-wire-contour glyph,\nsince #661 pins one glyph per kind). wire_contour's S9 fixture drops an\nundersize a wire machine now refuses (#560).\n\nRefs #532\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
