      "message": "Merge #1123's refreshed head into issue/533-wire-iso-post (posting.rs, machine/mod.rs, machine/parse.rs: keep both)\n\nParent-first refresh of the wire EDM stack (maintainer note on #1139):\nmain's #551/#560 code taken, #1139's additions re-applied on top -\nedm_codes beside edm_conditions, parse_codes beside the kind-aware\nparse_edm (`codes` joins COMMON_KEYS so main's key law admits it),\nWIRE_POSTS default in main's exhaustive default_post_for, and the\nWire Contour exception moved into posting_family::family_at_post.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
